        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86183, Zeus 8 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Zeus 8 Inch Solid Brass Pull is available in 5 different contemporary finish colors. This modern door pull has a unique shape that really sets it apart from other 8 inch door handles. It is easy to install on wood, metal, or fiberglass doors and comes packaged with all the hardware needed to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/zeus-solid-brass-8-inch-back-to-back-pull-set-emtek-btb-86183\"><b>Zeus Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Zeus Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
